  "context": {
    "passage": "*E-mail* =i\nTo: All Employees __)\nFrom: Ben Nonaka __|\nDate: [March 22 _]\nSubject: (important information about time-tracking software ]\n\nHello, everyone,\n\nPlease note that we will soon be retiring the Kronos time-tracking software, as it has\nbecome too expensive for us to support two time-tracking programs. Based on the usage\ndata we collected from the survey you completed last week, we have decided to\ncontinue using only the software the employees like better. Using only the Workmine\ntime-tracking software will allow us to provide better technical support and to maintain\nconsistency in our records across the company.\n\nFrom A pril 4 to A pril 21, my department will offer training sessions on migrating\nrecords to the Workmine application. Kronos users should take advantage of this\ntraining, since they will not be able to access the Kronos program after A pril 25.\nStarting on May 1, we will offer more-advanced Workmine training, including sessions\non ing reports and bleshooting. Please do not hesitate to contact me if you have\nquestions or concerns about this transition.\n\nSincerely,\n\nBen Nonaka\nDirector, Information Technology\n\n- = - =",
